<h2 id="seattle-kitchen-design-trends">Seattle Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Seattle kitchens lean Pacific-Northwest contemporary: natural wood tones, warm neutrals, matte finishes, and clean lines that suit the region's modern and craftsman homes. The city's remodel market favors transitional-to-modern work with two-tone schemes and warm-wood islands, while the affluent Eastside — backed by the tech economy — drives demand for sleek <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> kitchens.</p>
